# 512 mW. The restraint drives the published ice fraction through 0.9.
units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data data.seed
mass 1 18.0154
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 2.0 bin
timestep 10.0
velocity all create 230.0 2 dist gaussian
fix pl all plumed plumedfile plumed.smooth outfile plumed.out
fix npt all npt temp 230.0 230.0 200.0 iso 1.0 1.0 2000.0
thermo 4000
run 12000
